WEBVTT

00:21.520 --> 00:24.120
What do humans value the most?

00:25.000 --> 00:26.400
What drives them?

00:28.400 --> 00:29.880
Strength?

00:29.960 --> 00:31.920
-Go, O!
-Go, O!

00:33.920 --> 00:35.320
Good looks?

00:52.080 --> 00:53.360
Talent?

01:00.640 --> 01:02.680
Nice one, buddy. Yeah!

01:02.760 --> 01:03.920
-Hey!
-That was awesome.

01:04.000 --> 01:05.200
That hurts.

01:05.280 --> 01:07.240
GREEN 1 ORANGE 0

01:07.320 --> 01:08.600
Success?

01:09.720 --> 01:11.960
Who knew you can get so tired
by just standing there?

01:12.040 --> 01:13.240
Fuck, man.

01:17.640 --> 01:18.640
Hey, O.

01:20.880 --> 01:21.880
Love?

01:21.960 --> 01:23.240
Hey, Bam.

01:23.320 --> 01:24.560
Why'd you only give O his towel?

01:24.640 --> 01:26.760
-What about us?
-Get your own.

01:28.160 --> 01:29.440
Your drink.

01:29.520 --> 01:31.400
We only get plain water.

01:31.480 --> 01:32.640
What kind of manager are you?

01:32.720 --> 01:34.080
You're so biased.

01:34.600 --> 01:36.160
No, I'm not.

01:36.240 --> 01:39.040
It's only because O really deserves it.

01:39.120 --> 01:40.840
You didn't score one goal today, Teng.

01:40.920 --> 01:42.240
-Hey!
-Come on, Bam.

01:42.320 --> 01:43.920
-What?
-I'm the goalie.

01:44.600 --> 01:45.440
How would I score?

01:46.040 --> 01:47.600
And, Bam…

01:47.680 --> 01:49.320
I scored one last time.

01:49.400 --> 01:50.800
You didn't bring me anything.

01:51.400 --> 01:53.120
Well, I must have forgotten.

01:53.200 --> 01:54.200
What?

01:54.280 --> 01:56.040
-Hey, O.
-She never gives us anything special.

01:56.120 --> 01:57.440
Can we go out for ice cream later?

01:58.080 --> 01:59.920
My treat, to celebrate your victory.

02:00.000 --> 02:01.320
Please?

02:01.400 --> 02:03.400
I'm sorry, Bam. I have…

02:03.480 --> 02:04.760
to meet up with my mom today.

02:06.280 --> 02:07.480
That's so sweet.

02:08.120 --> 02:10.200
Will you please tell her hi for me?

02:10.760 --> 02:12.080
Yeah.

02:12.160 --> 02:14.480
You're awesome.

02:14.560 --> 02:15.880
And such a good son.

02:15.960 --> 02:17.680
-Hey, Por.
-Yes?

02:17.760 --> 02:18.840
I love my mom, too.

02:18.920 --> 02:20.440
Who cares?

02:23.560 --> 02:24.600
Por.

02:24.680 --> 02:26.920
When do you think Coach is bringing in
the new manager?

02:27.000 --> 02:29.160
-There's a new one?
-Oh, yes

02:29.240 --> 02:32.400
And they're supposed to be
very, very professional.

02:33.320 --> 02:35.360
That's the best news I've heard all day.

02:35.440 --> 02:37.200
I'm sure they won't play favorites.

02:37.800 --> 02:39.880
Like Bam does.

02:39.960 --> 02:41.800
They should hurry up.
I'm sick and tired of her.

02:41.880 --> 02:42.960
-You know what?
-That's true.

02:43.040 --> 02:44.920
Are you boys talking about me?

03:12.720 --> 03:13.840
Hey, guys.

03:14.320 --> 03:15.680
Here's the new manager.

03:16.320 --> 03:17.840
-Hey.
-Hello.

03:17.920 --> 03:19.360
I'm Nanno. Hi.

03:19.440 --> 03:20.280
Right.

03:20.360 --> 03:22.400
Bam, take care of Nanno.

03:22.480 --> 03:23.960
She's new.

03:24.040 --> 03:25.440
She's in the same year as you.

03:26.000 --> 03:27.440
She's not in my class.

03:29.160 --> 03:30.360
Coach.

03:30.440 --> 03:31.280
If you keep staring,

03:31.360 --> 03:33.000
your eyes will fall out.

03:33.080 --> 03:35.320
-How's your ankle?
-It's feeling better.

03:41.040 --> 03:44.520
So what drives a human the most…

03:49.600 --> 03:51.200
is hatred.

05:05.560 --> 05:06.400
Hey.

05:06.480 --> 05:08.080
-Okay, okay. I will.
-What's wrong?

05:08.840 --> 05:10.440
-Nanno, dear.
-Yes?

05:10.520 --> 05:13.240
I heard that you were the manager
of your previous school's team.

05:13.320 --> 05:14.600
Is that true?

05:14.680 --> 05:16.400
-That's right. Yeah.
-Wow.

05:16.960 --> 05:19.160
What kind of manager are you,
if you don't mind me asking?

05:19.240 --> 05:20.440
The scary, fear-mongering kind,

05:20.520 --> 05:21.880
or the loving, caring kind?

05:21.960 --> 05:24.800
-Be honest, yeah?
-I'm… fine with anything.

05:24.880 --> 05:26.480
As long as she's not biased.

05:26.560 --> 05:27.560
Teng.

05:28.200 --> 05:30.400
-You better watch out, you hear me?
-I think I'm imposing.

05:30.480 --> 05:32.560
It's my first day
and you're paying for my meal.

05:32.640 --> 05:34.880
I should be the one who pays for yours.

05:34.960 --> 05:36.800
It's our duty. It's…

05:37.440 --> 05:40.040
We just want to give you
a warm welcome, okay?

05:40.120 --> 05:41.160
O, we have to

05:41.240 --> 05:42.720
-welcome her to our school, right?
-Mm!

05:43.280 --> 05:44.120
Hey O!

05:44.200 --> 05:45.560
When are you meeting your mom?

05:45.640 --> 05:48.720
What mom? I don't have one.
Teng doesn't have one either.

05:50.760 --> 05:52.440
-Here's your ice cream, Nanno.
-Thank you.

05:53.440 --> 05:55.840
-I really love the toppings.
-I chose them myself.

05:55.920 --> 05:57.440
Mmm…

05:58.760 --> 06:00.240
Is it good, Nanno?

06:00.320 --> 06:01.160
It is.

06:05.120 --> 06:07.120
Mmm…

06:14.680 --> 06:15.960
O, pass it here.

06:16.040 --> 06:17.280
Pass it to me.

06:17.360 --> 06:19.200
Keep it up, everyone!

06:23.440 --> 06:24.520
Hey, O!

06:25.440 --> 06:26.520
O, pass it.

06:26.600 --> 06:27.880
Go for it!

06:27.960 --> 06:28.840
Pass it to me.

06:28.920 --> 06:30.240
Hey!

06:30.320 --> 06:32.200
Go boys! Come on, let's go!

06:38.560 --> 06:39.800
Yeah!

06:48.160 --> 06:50.320
When you're done with the balls,
go and pick up the cups.

06:50.400 --> 06:51.400
Sure.

06:57.360 --> 06:59.400
And don't forget the towels
that are over there.

07:00.720 --> 07:01.840
Hurry up.

07:01.920 --> 07:03.400
Okay, no problem.

07:10.760 --> 07:12.800
And the basket right over there.

07:14.760 --> 07:16.320
Can you carry that all by yourself?

07:16.400 --> 07:17.640
Yeah.

07:18.760 --> 07:19.600
Bam…

07:19.680 --> 07:22.040
She's just arrived,
and you're being so hard on her.

07:22.120 --> 07:24.920
No. I'm just training her.

07:26.800 --> 07:28.440
Here, let me help you.

07:29.560 --> 07:31.000
The hallway to the storeroom is dark.

07:31.080 --> 07:33.280
-The light's out in there.
-Thank you.

07:33.360 --> 07:34.520
Hey, O.

07:34.600 --> 07:36.400
Oh, my gosh. Here you go.

07:36.480 --> 07:38.560
Pack it with me.

07:40.280 --> 07:42.160
Come on. Let me take it.

07:42.240 --> 07:44.240
That's okay. It's not far.

07:44.320 --> 07:45.360
Okay. Okay.

08:34.400 --> 08:38.400
NANNO, YOU STINKFACE BITCH

09:12.120 --> 09:15.400
NANNO, YOU STINKFACE BITCH

09:55.080 --> 09:56.400
LOVE KICK

09:56.480 --> 09:58.600
EP 1: THE BEGINNING
BY BAMOH

10:01.320 --> 10:02.320
COMMENTS

10:02.400 --> 10:03.920
THIS IS SUPER FUN. SUBSCRIBED.

10:04.000 --> 10:06.360
LOVE IT. WHEN'S THE NEXT EPISODE?

10:06.440 --> 10:07.800
MY HEART'S POUNDING. I'M BLUSHING.

10:33.720 --> 10:34.720
What now?

10:35.840 --> 10:36.800
Nothing.

10:36.880 --> 10:38.000
Can't I have a look?

10:38.080 --> 10:39.080
No.

10:40.600 --> 10:42.960
Why do you still write it down
before you type it?

10:43.040 --> 10:45.000
Are you a Neanderthal or something?

10:45.080 --> 10:46.960
Neanderthals didn't use paper.

10:47.040 --> 10:48.960
"Neanderthals didn't use paper."

10:49.040 --> 10:49.920
Anyway…

10:50.000 --> 10:52.720
the episode you posted last week
got a lot of compliments.

10:53.520 --> 10:55.040
You're getting popular!

10:56.760 --> 10:59.160
There's one comment that I really like.

10:59.240 --> 11:01.120
It says…

11:01.920 --> 11:03.520
"Boring as shit."

11:03.600 --> 11:05.360
-Stop it.
-Why?

11:05.440 --> 11:06.800
Does it hurt your feelings?

11:18.720 --> 11:21.720
I'M IN EUPHORIA. I LOVE IT. WRITE MORE.

11:21.800 --> 11:24.960
"THE VOICE THAT UNDID HER." AWESOME.

11:49.360 --> 11:51.640
Today, O scored a goal.

11:52.280 --> 11:54.880
He's so good and talented and kind.

11:54.960 --> 11:56.400
He's such a cutie.

11:56.920 --> 11:58.920
When he turned to look at his fans,

11:59.000 --> 12:00.560
my palms were sweating.

12:01.600 --> 12:03.280
But then a new girl arrived.

12:03.800 --> 12:05.320
Her name is Nanno.

12:05.400 --> 12:07.560
What an irritating bitch.

12:07.640 --> 12:10.080
She's going to be my co-manager.

12:10.160 --> 12:12.280
She's literally the worst.

12:12.840 --> 12:15.000
So I wrote shit about her
on the bathroom wall,

12:15.080 --> 12:16.240
and guess what?

12:16.320 --> 12:17.640
She saw it.

12:18.760 --> 12:20.000
That was satisfying.

12:20.080 --> 12:21.480
I hope she doesn't last the week.

12:21.560 --> 12:22.800
I can't stand her.

12:22.880 --> 12:24.800
She acts like she's so pretty.

12:24.880 --> 12:26.840
Teng and Por kept staring at her.

12:26.920 --> 12:28.640
They can all go to hell.

12:45.680 --> 12:49.600
BAM, THANKS SO MUCH FOR THE TOWEL.

12:49.680 --> 12:51.120
PLEASE HELP NANNO SETTLE IN.

12:51.200 --> 12:53.880
SHE TOLD ME SHE WANTS TO LEARN.
TAKE CARE OF HER.

13:07.760 --> 13:09.520
-Oops.
-Hey!

13:09.600 --> 13:10.920
You dropped one.

13:13.080 --> 13:14.120
Um…

13:14.600 --> 13:15.600
Oh, no.

13:16.120 --> 13:17.680
Oh, my.

13:22.200 --> 13:23.800
Go and wash them right now.

13:24.480 --> 13:25.680
They really stink.

13:25.760 --> 13:27.480
Of course.

13:34.360 --> 13:35.760
Come here.

13:35.840 --> 13:37.080
I'll help.

13:37.160 --> 13:38.520
-Hey, O.
-Hey.

13:38.600 --> 13:40.000
It's okay.

13:40.640 --> 13:42.520
Well, thanks so much, Bam.

13:51.280 --> 13:52.680
They are clean.

14:17.760 --> 14:18.920
Hmm…

14:29.520 --> 14:30.640
-Hey, Por.
-What?

14:30.720 --> 14:32.320
Help the defense after passing the ball.

14:32.400 --> 14:33.960
I'm a winger. I have to be at the front.

14:34.040 --> 14:35.400
I can't take them all by ourselves.

14:35.480 --> 14:37.880
-Tell the other defenders.
-Just listen to me next time.

14:38.840 --> 14:39.920
What the hell?

14:40.920 --> 14:42.160
Bam…

14:42.240 --> 14:43.840
Did you take a shit in here?

14:43.920 --> 14:45.440
-Stop it now.
-Why does it stink so bad?

14:45.520 --> 14:46.560
Something stinks.

14:46.640 --> 14:48.120
Are you saying that Nanno farted?

14:48.760 --> 14:50.040
No, I didn't.

14:50.120 --> 14:50.960
See?

14:51.560 --> 14:53.520
Nanno would never do something like that.

14:54.240 --> 14:55.320
Bam.

14:55.400 --> 14:56.680
You're just jealous because

14:56.760 --> 14:58.920
we like the new girl more than you.

15:00.520 --> 15:02.200
You're like an evil stepmother.

15:02.280 --> 15:03.720
Think whatever you want.

15:05.800 --> 15:07.000
Hey, O.

15:07.080 --> 15:09.360
-Nanno, can I have some water?
-Of course.

15:09.440 --> 15:11.280
Let's get out of here
before we reek of shit.

15:11.360 --> 15:12.640
-What's that?
-What do you think?1

15:12.720 --> 15:13.840
I don't know.

15:15.360 --> 15:16.600
Here you go, O.

15:19.880 --> 15:21.480
Nanno.

15:21.560 --> 15:22.440
Yeah?

15:22.520 --> 15:23.560
You'll have to excuse me.

15:24.400 --> 15:27.000
Why?

15:30.080 --> 15:31.040
Bam, Bam.

15:31.120 --> 15:32.960
Tell me what's wrong with everybody.

15:33.440 --> 15:34.880
Come on. Tell me, Bam.

15:36.120 --> 15:37.320
Everyone, please!

15:54.360 --> 15:56.440
This can't possibly be coming…

15:57.120 --> 15:58.320
Can't be…

15:58.960 --> 16:00.760
This can't be coming from me?

16:07.920 --> 16:09.720
I'm so sorry everyone.

16:14.800 --> 16:18.360
NANNO, YOU STINKFACE BITCH

16:46.880 --> 16:48.800
I think you should try something.

16:49.480 --> 16:50.360
Bam?

16:50.440 --> 16:52.800
Cosmetics, face wash, perfume.

16:53.280 --> 16:55.720
There are a lot to choose from.

16:55.800 --> 16:57.280
It might stop your face from stinking.

16:58.080 --> 16:59.280
Seriously.

17:03.040 --> 17:05.400
But I really don't know
which one to choose.

17:08.240 --> 17:10.400
Maybe I should just buy everything.

17:17.640 --> 17:19.560
Would you like some, too?

17:37.280 --> 17:44.200
O LOVES BAM VERY MUCH

18:01.600 --> 18:03.240
O, SATTAWAT PHUPHA

18:03.320 --> 18:05.280
GRADE 12 CLASS 2
FOOTBALL PLAYER NO. 7

18:13.160 --> 18:15.160
BAM, WIPHADA CHEUNCHOM

18:15.240 --> 18:17.440
GRADE 10 CLASS 3
FOOTBALL TEAM MANAGER

18:27.360 --> 18:28.480
Mmm…

18:37.200 --> 18:39.160
Bam, someone's here to see you.

18:39.240 --> 18:41.080
Who? Please tell me it's O.

18:41.160 --> 18:42.560
It's Coach Vinai.

18:51.560 --> 18:52.760
Bam.

18:52.840 --> 18:54.200
-Bam?
-Yeah?

18:54.720 --> 18:56.160
How's Nanno doing as the manager?

18:56.240 --> 18:57.080
Is she any good?

18:57.160 --> 18:58.800
-She's okay.
-Good.

18:58.880 --> 19:00.520
At first I thought,
you wouldn't get along.

19:00.600 --> 19:02.120
But if she can help, it's fine by me.

19:03.800 --> 19:05.320
And, Bam.

19:05.960 --> 19:07.120
-Bam.
-Yeah?

19:07.600 --> 19:09.600
Please be more careful with the food.

19:09.680 --> 19:12.280
I heard all of you got really sick
earlier today.

19:12.360 --> 19:13.640
What did you all eat?

19:13.720 --> 19:14.760
Pass it here.

19:14.840 --> 19:16.080
I don't know.

19:16.160 --> 19:18.360
Well, take care of it. That's it.

19:18.440 --> 19:20.080
-Thanks.
-Not so hard!

19:20.160 --> 19:21.800
Oh shit!

19:33.920 --> 19:35.080
Are you all right?

19:37.160 --> 19:38.560
I'm fine.

19:48.040 --> 19:49.840
I wasn't asking you. I asked him.

19:51.320 --> 19:52.840
I'm all right. Thanks buddy.

19:52.920 --> 19:55.040
Teng, be careful.

19:55.120 --> 19:56.720
Watch where you're kicking the ball.

19:56.800 --> 19:58.920
If it hits anyone,
you're not the only one in trouble.

19:59.000 --> 20:00.280
Both of us will get it.

20:00.360 --> 20:02.520
-Now get over here and apologize.
-You're an idiot, Teng.

20:02.600 --> 20:05.040
-Real idiot.
-I'm sorry, Coach.

20:06.000 --> 20:08.160
-Haven't you had enough practice?
-We have, Coach.

20:08.240 --> 20:09.440
Do you want to stay for more?

20:09.520 --> 20:11.240
-No thanks, Coach.
-Just a bit more, for fun.

20:11.320 --> 20:13.400
-We were just having fun.
-We were just playing around.

20:13.480 --> 20:14.880
Let's talk offense, Coach.

20:14.960 --> 20:16.760
-Fine.
-Let's go.

20:20.680 --> 20:22.000
Hey, Bam.

20:22.680 --> 20:23.920
You didn't get hit, did you?

20:24.000 --> 20:25.800
-Why?
-You're bleeding.

20:29.520 --> 20:30.560
Hey.

20:30.640 --> 20:32.920
Don't tell me you thought
O was protecting you.

20:33.440 --> 20:34.440
Oh, I see.

20:34.520 --> 20:36.520
Your heart is beating so hard
and you got a nosebleed

20:36.600 --> 20:38.480
just because a guy got close to you.

20:40.040 --> 20:41.680
How's that even possible, Bam?

20:41.760 --> 20:43.600
Who the hell would want to protect you?

20:44.200 --> 20:45.200
Let me be blunt.

20:45.280 --> 20:47.560
If a ball was going to hit
either you or a dog,

20:47.640 --> 20:49.320
I would jump right in front of the dog.

20:49.400 --> 20:51.720
Don't give me that look.

20:52.360 --> 20:53.920
It really doesn't suit you.

20:54.000 --> 20:57.120
Usually, I would say it's cute
when a girl gives a sideways glance.

20:57.200 --> 20:59.080
But on your face, I think it's horrible.

20:59.720 --> 21:01.440
-Stop it.
-What?

21:04.600 --> 21:05.600
What?

21:06.240 --> 21:08.920
Is your heart pounding
for me now too? Bam?

21:09.400 --> 21:10.400
Hey.

21:11.040 --> 21:12.640
I must be getting my father's good looks.

21:23.680 --> 21:27.800
TENG IS A DOG

21:38.160 --> 21:40.600
-Hey, Teng.
-Teng, what the fuck is wrong?

21:42.000 --> 21:44.640
-Teng, what's wrong?
-He's lost his mind.

21:44.720 --> 21:45.560
What the hell?

21:45.640 --> 21:47.320
Teng, stop it.

21:47.400 --> 21:49.280
-Hey Teng, snap out of it!
-Hey.

21:49.360 --> 21:50.920
-Hey. Hey.
-What the fuck?

21:51.000 --> 21:52.040
Hey.

21:52.120 --> 21:53.520
Snap out of it! Come on.

21:59.720 --> 22:00.760
What are you doing?

22:00.840 --> 22:02.240
You're here to practice.

22:02.320 --> 22:04.560
-What's wrong with you, Teng?
-Something happened to Teng.

22:04.640 --> 22:05.600
-What's wrong?
-Oh!

22:05.680 --> 22:07.480
Hey, hey!

22:08.600 --> 22:09.640
Get him!

22:10.360 --> 22:12.000
What the fuck is wrong with you?

22:12.080 --> 22:14.240
-Get it together, Teng.
-What are you doing?

22:14.320 --> 22:16.400
Teng.

22:17.600 --> 22:18.720
You're good.

22:18.800 --> 22:21.240
-They said he behaves like a dog.
-Please take care of him.

22:25.840 --> 22:28.120
-What's going on?
-What happened?

22:32.800 --> 22:33.960
Bam, Bam, Bam.

22:34.040 --> 22:35.480
What's wrong with Teng?

22:36.120 --> 22:38.200
Why the hell is he acting like a dog?

22:38.760 --> 22:41.160
Is he going to recover
in time for nationals?

22:41.920 --> 22:43.320
Don't worry, Nanno.

22:44.200 --> 22:45.880
I'm sorry.

23:38.880 --> 23:44.480
NANNO IS A DOG

24:08.280 --> 24:10.280
You can put away your plate, Bam.

24:10.360 --> 24:11.600
No, I'm staying here.

24:35.880 --> 24:42.840
O LOVES BAM VERY MUCH

24:48.440 --> 24:49.480
What are you doing?

24:51.080 --> 24:53.000
-Just testing pens.
-Right.

24:53.080 --> 24:54.640
That's some serious work.

24:54.720 --> 24:56.320
Testing your pens.

24:57.080 --> 24:59.720
Why don't you come down
and help us out with the chores instead?

25:00.840 --> 25:01.680
No thanks.

25:06.720 --> 25:07.920
What are you even writing?

25:08.000 --> 25:09.120
Let me see.

25:09.200 --> 25:10.280
Come on.

25:10.360 --> 25:11.200
Hey.

25:11.680 --> 25:13.200
I thought you took calligraphy.

25:13.280 --> 25:14.800
What are you writing? Spells?

25:15.560 --> 25:16.800
Go away.

25:24.480 --> 25:25.920
BAM, CAN WE TALK?

25:31.920 --> 25:33.480
OF COURSE.

25:35.080 --> 25:38.280
I HAVE SOMETHING TO ASK YOU.

25:42.240 --> 25:45.320
ABOUT WHAT?

25:51.800 --> 25:58.360
WILL YOU BE MY GIRLFRIEND?

26:02.560 --> 26:05.400
IT'S ABOUT NANNO.

26:44.120 --> 26:47.040
I wish that the things
I wrote in my diary came true.

26:47.520 --> 26:49.440
Like the the things I write on the wall.

26:49.520 --> 26:51.120
Then I'd truly have it all.

26:51.200 --> 26:52.520
I'd be like a superhero.

26:53.160 --> 26:55.240
Defeating all of my enemies.

27:08.840 --> 27:10.080
Hey, Mom.

27:10.160 --> 27:11.600
I'm going to stop by.

27:11.680 --> 27:14.040
I'm going to help your sister
pack up and move.

27:14.800 --> 27:16.720
Okay, Mom.

27:16.800 --> 27:19.600
But she never said anything about moving.

27:19.680 --> 27:22.200
What? She told me months ago.

27:22.280 --> 27:23.880
I thought she would have told you.

27:23.960 --> 27:25.280
Fuck, no.

27:26.480 --> 27:27.640
Where are your manners?

27:27.720 --> 27:29.440
Don't talk to me like that.

27:29.520 --> 27:30.800
I'm sorry.

27:32.040 --> 27:34.720
I'm going to bed, Mom. I'm tired.

27:35.240 --> 27:36.800
See you tomorrow then.

27:36.880 --> 27:38.000
Okay.

27:53.160 --> 27:55.960
NANNO, YOU STINKFACE BITCH

27:56.040 --> 27:58.120
TENG IS A DOG

28:05.360 --> 28:06.760
-Come here, bitch.
-Ow!

28:07.360 --> 28:08.680
Ow!

28:08.760 --> 28:12.400
This is for giving us
the wrong answers to the homework.

28:16.560 --> 28:19.400
And this one is for doing Poj's homework.

28:19.480 --> 28:21.320
He got the right answers,

28:21.400 --> 28:23.440
but you gave us bullshit.

28:23.520 --> 28:25.360
Poj paid me. You didn't.

28:26.000 --> 28:27.440
Do you want some payment? Here.

28:27.520 --> 28:28.400
No.

28:28.480 --> 28:29.880
Next time,

28:29.960 --> 28:31.600
don't be a such a smart-ass.

28:31.680 --> 28:34.440
If one word of my homework
is different than yours,

28:34.520 --> 28:36.080
what you'll get is worse than this.

28:37.640 --> 28:39.520
Bye, bitch.

29:06.400 --> 29:07.840
I heard everything.

29:18.360 --> 29:19.360
Hey.

29:21.000 --> 29:23.040
If you truly hate someone,

29:24.240 --> 29:25.720
you could try writing on the wall.

29:27.200 --> 29:29.320
I find it's a good way to let off steam.

29:32.800 --> 29:33.640
And sometimes,

29:34.280 --> 29:35.680
the things you write…

29:36.280 --> 29:37.320
come true.

29:38.880 --> 29:40.280
Like God's listening…

29:41.080 --> 29:43.240
to all of your prayers,
or something like that.

29:48.160 --> 29:50.040
You mean on the walls in here?

29:50.760 --> 29:51.800
Mm-hmm.

29:53.760 --> 29:54.600
Wanna try?

30:09.000 --> 30:10.280
Fine then.

30:15.320 --> 30:16.960
Hey! This place is for learning,

30:17.040 --> 30:18.600
not for catfights.

30:18.680 --> 30:19.800
Kids these days.

30:19.880 --> 30:22.120
If you have so much time on your hands,
open a book.

30:22.200 --> 30:23.640
Oy!

30:23.720 --> 30:24.880
You, too?

30:24.960 --> 30:27.320
It's time for class,
and you're here chitchatting.

30:27.800 --> 30:29.720
Hiding here all day,
wasting your education.

30:29.800 --> 30:31.760
What's wrong with these kids?

30:38.440 --> 30:39.680
Come on, pass it.

30:47.480 --> 30:48.360
Hey, O.

30:49.520 --> 30:50.680
Hey, O.

30:53.680 --> 30:54.960
Hey, O.

31:01.160 --> 31:02.320
Hey, O.

31:06.360 --> 31:07.520
I brought you some…

31:08.160 --> 31:09.480
Here you go.

31:09.560 --> 31:11.520
-And the cold one is for Por.
-Thank you.

31:12.400 --> 31:13.320
Hey!

31:13.400 --> 31:15.120
You stink. Why are you even here?

31:15.200 --> 31:17.120
You made everyone sick last time.

31:17.960 --> 31:19.240
What are you talking about?

31:19.320 --> 31:21.080
She doesn't stink at all.

31:23.200 --> 31:24.960
She smells great.

31:29.440 --> 31:30.760
Are you tired?

31:30.840 --> 31:32.160
-Exhausted.
-Yes.

31:37.800 --> 31:39.080
-Hey.
-Hey, Teng.

31:39.160 --> 31:40.680
-Hello there. Huh?
-What the hell?

31:41.400 --> 31:42.640
Man, are you all right?

31:42.720 --> 31:44.760
Yes. I don't know what happened.

31:44.840 --> 31:46.920
You're not barking anymore, are you?

31:47.000 --> 31:49.280
-Here. Have some water, Doggie.
-Okay.

31:49.360 --> 31:50.640
Woof, woof.

31:50.720 --> 31:52.400
-Woof, woof.
-Woof, woof.

31:52.480 --> 31:54.440
-Do you expect me to be a dog forever?
-Hey!

31:54.520 --> 31:56.560
Don't try to bite me again today. Okay?

31:56.640 --> 31:57.480
I won't.

31:58.480 --> 31:59.560
Hey!

32:00.280 --> 32:01.120
Keep moving.

32:01.200 --> 32:03.200
-Teng, you're so funny.
-Let me lick your face.

32:03.280 --> 32:04.560
-Come here.
-Stop it, asshole.

32:04.640 --> 32:05.560
That's enough.

32:12.760 --> 32:14.480
Stop! What are you doing?

32:14.560 --> 32:16.720
You know about it, don't you? Is that why?

32:16.800 --> 32:18.480
Come on. Don't clean it up!

32:18.560 --> 32:20.000
Did that girl Good tell you about it?

32:20.080 --> 32:22.400
What? It was you who did that?

32:22.480 --> 32:24.480
And your friend, right?
Who else is involved?

32:24.560 --> 32:26.240
Stop acting like you don't know.

32:26.320 --> 32:27.920
Why the hell are you cleaning it up?

32:28.000 --> 32:30.520
I have to because it's my damn job.

32:30.600 --> 32:32.480
They pay me to clean up here.

32:32.560 --> 32:34.320
What do you expect me to do?

32:34.800 --> 32:35.720
Give me that.

32:35.800 --> 32:37.480
Now get out of here. Scram!

32:38.000 --> 32:39.480
You have to stop. Stop it.

32:39.560 --> 32:40.920
Stop it!

32:41.000 --> 32:43.200
Stop! Just please don't clean it up.

32:43.280 --> 32:44.280
-Come on.
-What?

32:44.880 --> 32:46.320
I'll get in trouble if I don't do it.

32:47.080 --> 32:48.240
You won't.

32:48.320 --> 32:50.000
-How do you know?
-Well…

32:54.400 --> 32:56.080
Come on. Just stop.

32:56.160 --> 32:57.640
I'll tell you a secret.

32:58.400 --> 33:00.040
If you write about someone,

33:00.120 --> 33:02.360
wishing they would shut up, they will.

33:02.440 --> 33:04.040
The wall is enchanted.

33:04.120 --> 33:05.480
You really get what you write.

33:05.560 --> 33:07.040
I swear to God.

33:08.240 --> 33:09.720
Just believe me.

33:11.600 --> 33:13.800
I haven't told anyone except you.

33:16.800 --> 33:18.640
How does this sound to you, huh?

33:18.720 --> 33:21.160
If you don't clean it today,
I'll let you write something.

33:21.240 --> 33:22.600
Anything you want.

33:36.000 --> 33:37.240
-You brat!
-Oh!

33:38.680 --> 33:40.760
Do you think that I would fall
for your stupid prank

33:40.840 --> 33:42.160
just because I'm a janitor?

33:42.240 --> 33:43.480
You can't fool me.

33:44.720 --> 33:45.960
Now I know that you wrote this,

33:46.040 --> 33:47.320
I'm going to tell on you.

33:47.400 --> 33:49.000
Is this what I get for offering to help?

33:49.080 --> 33:50.800
You're not offering anything.

33:50.880 --> 33:53.280
Nobody's stupid enough to believe you.

33:54.960 --> 33:56.520
If you want to fool someone,

33:56.600 --> 33:58.080
try using what you learn in class.

33:58.160 --> 34:00.200
Use your brain for once in your life.

34:01.280 --> 34:03.800
Writings on the wall coming true?

34:03.880 --> 34:05.640
Everybody would have STDs by now.

34:05.720 --> 34:08.680
How have they not
kicked you out of school yet, huh?

34:14.120 --> 34:16.120
Your parents sent you here to learn.

34:16.200 --> 34:18.520
You could try learning some manners, too.

34:40.240 --> 34:43.280
One of the students from your team,
the small, short-haired one,

34:43.360 --> 34:45.160
has no manners at all.

34:45.240 --> 34:47.200
She wrote all over the bathroom wall.

34:47.280 --> 34:48.960
It's completely covered.

34:49.040 --> 34:51.480
She also wouldn't let me clean it off.

34:51.560 --> 34:53.280
And then she raised her voice at me.

34:53.360 --> 34:55.520
I'll make sure
she's dealt with accordingly.

35:07.320 --> 35:08.160
Bam.

35:09.000 --> 35:09.840
Coach?

35:11.440 --> 35:12.360
Don't ever do it again.

35:15.400 --> 35:16.520
I won't.

35:16.600 --> 35:17.600
I'm sorry.

35:19.320 --> 35:21.360
I decided to appoint you as manager

35:21.840 --> 35:23.640
because I believe
that you are a good leader.

35:24.800 --> 35:25.800
But also,

35:26.360 --> 35:27.880
I put my trust in you.

35:30.000 --> 35:31.000
Yes.

35:32.520 --> 35:33.960
Do you understand me?

35:35.520 --> 35:36.400
Yeah.

35:38.640 --> 35:40.320
Go and apologize to the cleaner.

35:40.880 --> 35:42.080
She's still around.

35:44.440 --> 35:45.640
Go.

35:46.320 --> 35:47.560
Fine.

36:53.000 --> 36:53.840
Huh?

37:16.200 --> 37:18.640
I think I might be sick.

37:24.720 --> 37:27.200
Writings on the wall coming true?

37:27.280 --> 37:29.720
How have they not kicked you
out of school yet?

37:51.520 --> 37:55.040
NOSEY CLEANER BITCH
I HOPE YOU SUFFOCATE AND DIE

37:56.000 --> 37:57.720
I saw your writing on the wall.

37:58.440 --> 38:00.120
Do you think it's really enchanted?

39:11.240 --> 39:13.160
Subtitle translation by
Mingchut Anuwatnonthaket
